# Edit / Detail Screen Layout (Card, Form, Sections)

Use this structure for edit and detail (read-only) pages so layout stays consistent.

## Page wrapper

- AppLayout does NOT provide any paddings on purpose
- Use `.p-page` class for page paddings which provides paddings for responsive states
- You may use full with headers with card background
- **The page owns its own scroll.** AppLayout gives the content pane a bounded
  height but NO overflow, so a plain centered `<div>` will clip long content
  instead of scrolling. Always wrap the page in a scroll container:
  ```tsx
  // ✅ outer scroll container + inner centered column
  <div className="flex min-h-0 w-full flex-1 flex-col overflow-auto">
    <div className="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl space-y-6 p-page">
      {/* sections */}
    </div>
  </div>
  // ❌ no scroll container — long pages clip, main area won't scroll
  <div className="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-6 p-page">…</div>
  ```
  The `flex min-h-0 … overflow-auto` is what enables scrolling — without
  `min-h-0` the flex child refuses to shrink and `overflow-auto` never engages.
- Single scrollable column, centered: `mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-6` (inside the
  scroll container above).
- Keep relevant info sticky when scrolling if needed for large pages
- Edit pages: one `<Form>` wrapping one `<form className="space-y-6">`.

## Sections and headings (outside the card)

- **Section** = `<section className="space-y-2">` with heading and optional description *outside* the card, then the card as the next sibling.
- **Heading**: `<h2 className="text-lg font-medium">` (translated). Optional: `<p className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">` below the heading.
- **Do not** put the section title inside the card. Heading and card are siblings inside the section.

## Cards

- Use **Card** from `@engenty/ui-core` with **variant="form"** for each block (light background, padding, spacing).
- One card per section. For a distinct sub-block inside a card (e.g. Contracts), use `<h3 className="mb-2 text-sm font-medium">` and `border-t pt-4` (or `mt-4 pt-4`).

## Edit forms: fields inside cards

- **FormItem variant="row"** for label + control in one row (no extra layout classes on `FormLabel` / `FormControl`).
- Use **Textarea** for multi-line fields, **DatePicker** for dates, **FileInput** for file upload where appropriate.

## Do / Don’t

```tsx
// ✅ Heading outside card
<section className="space-y-2">
  <div>
    <h2 className="text-lg font-medium">{t("sectionTitle")}</h2>
    <p className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">{t("sectionDescription")}</p>
  </div>
  <Card variant="form">
    ...
  </Card>
</section>

// ❌ Heading inside card
<Card variant="form">
  <h2>Section</h2>
  ...
</Card>
```

```tsx
// ✅ Sub-block inside card
<Card variant="form">
  <FormField ... />
  <div className="border-t pt-4 mt-4">
    <h3 className="mb-2 text-sm font-medium">{t("contracts")}</h3>
    ...
  </div>
</Card>
```

